/// @file
/// The groups the API reference is arranged in, one page each. Each public
/// header adds its declarations to one of these, and docs/sphinx/api renders
/// a group with Breathe's doxygengroup directive, which shows its members
/// without the enclosing namespace. Rendering headers one by one
/// instead declared `namespace proxima` once per header, and Sphinx rejects
/// the duplicates.

/// @defgroup expressions Expressions
/// @defgroup results Results and errors
/// @defgroup assumptions Assumptions
/// @defgroup operations Operations
/// @defgroup kernel The kernel
/// @defgroup rendering Rendering
/// @defgroup numeric Numeric evaluation
/// @defgroup traversal Traversal
